{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/azure-cognitive-services/speechservices/text-to-speech","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:12:05.515Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/azure-cognitive-services/speechservices/text-to-speech/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/azure-cognitive-services/speechservices/text-to-speech/about"},"readme":"> [!IMPORTANT]\n> We retired the standard speech synthesis voices and text-to-speech container on August 31, 2021. Consider migrating your applications to use the neural text-to-speech container instead. For more information on updating your application, see [Migrate from standard voice to prebuilt neural voice](./how-to-migrate-to-prebuilt-neural-voice.md).\n\n## About\n\n[Azure AI services](http://aka.ms/cognitive-services) is a set of APIs, SDKs and container images that enables developers to integrate ready-made AI directly into their applications. Azure AI services contains a broad set of capabilities including text analytics; facial detection, speech and vision recognition; natural language understanding, and more.\n\nContainer support in Azure AI services allow developers to use the same rich APIs that are available in Azure but with the flexibility that comes with containers. See [Container support in Azure AI services](http://aka.ms/cognitive-services-containers) for details.\n\n[Text to Speech](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cognitive-services/speech-service/speech-container-howto) from the [Speech](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cognitive-services/speech-service/) service enables your applications, tools, or devices to convert text into human-like synthesized speech.\n\n## Featured tags\n\n- `latest`\ndocker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-cognitive-services/speechservices/text-to-speech\n\n## Related repositories\n\n+ [Speech-to-Text](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-azure-cognitive-services-speechservices-speech-to-text)\n+ [Custom Speech-to-Text](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-azure-cognitive-services-speechservices-custom-speech-to-text)\n+ [Neural Text-to-Speech](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-azure-cognitive-services-speechservices-neural-text-to-speech)\n+ [Language Detection](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-azure-cognitive-services-speechservices-language-detection)\n+ [Azure AI services Images](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-azure-cognitive-services): Azure AI services is a set of APIs, SDKs and container images that enables developers to integrate ready-made AI directly into their applications.\n\n## Configuration\n\nSee the [configuration documentation](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cognitive-services/speech-service/speech-container-configuration) for how to configure this image.\n\n## Usage\n\nSee the [How-to](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cognitive-services/speech-service/speech-container-howto?tabs=tts%2Ccsharp%2Csimple-format) for how to use this image.\n\n## Related Information\n\n+ [Speech-to-Text Azure Cognitive Service](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cognitive-services/speech-service/speech-container-howto)\n+ [Container Support in Azure AI services](http://aka.ms/cognitive-services-containers)\n+ [Azure AI services](http://aka.ms/cognitive-services)\n+ [Azure Portal](http://portal.azure.com)\n\n## Support\n\nReport feedback or issues on [Stack Overflow](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2056278) using tag azure-cognitive-services.\n\n## License\n\n- Legal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice)\n\n\nNotice: Copyright © Microsoft Corporation 2020. This Azure AI services Container image is made available to you under the [terms governing your subscription to Microsoft Azure Services](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2018657) (including the [Online Services Terms](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2018760)). If you do not have a valid Azure subscription, then you may not use this container.","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2021-09-28T19:38:00.8322659+00:00","categories":[],"keywords":[],"license":"Other","links":[{"name":"licence","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/licensing/terms/product/ForOnlineServices/EAEAS"}],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"pullsText":"2.7M+","stars":null},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"1.16.0-amd64-pt-br-heloisarus","digest":"sha256:8bfdae115e747e812d2368be9f0081431c385a886730115f5626c48f8e2c7865","pushed":"2021-09-28T19:38:01.0000000+00:00","size":15774,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"1.16.0-amd64-zh-tw-hanhanrus","digest":"sha256:8dfa0c14648b25b616aae80397cd9da54b09b196914d4296f1b8d8e14f0b1a48","pushed":"2021-09-28T19:32:32.0000000+00:00","size":15771,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"1.16.0-amd64-zh-cn-huihuirus","digest":"sha256:e530b40a0bc93d2a6161239499e4290caa4153497ca8410e9c65d49b34cddb68","pushed":"2021-09-28T19:32:30.0000000+00:00","size":15768,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"1.16.0-amd64-zh-tw-zhiwei-apollo","digest":"sha256:f0785f701da7dc9199ed5e2ca86a3e47776e15a6f0a8752c397a99de3ea9894b","pushed":"2021-09-28T19:31:07.0000000+00:00","size":15780,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"1.16.0-amd64-zh-tw-yating-apollo","digest":"sha256:a70c0795364ae9f6d4990ba4ccc728de562a339a22c9df2c8ed5689c2c30e0cc","pushed":"2021-09-28T19:31:01.0000000+00:00","size":15783,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"1.16.0-amd64-zh-hk-tr